    "created_at": "2024-12-11T12:39:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-11T12:39:51Z",
    "body": "Well the load event is the only way an earlier-inserted frame can observe that a later-inserted iframe’s content window is null, and has not yet been created yet, because the nested document is created during the post-connection steps, at the same timing as the load event. So it is about the load event, but also about nested document creation.",
